# SM (soft): the CLIENT shapes of the coding agents on the baked traffic profile, none of them in the hang or the timed jobs: a STREAMED tool call (parser M re-chunks only this path), a streamed reasoning answer,
# the first steady prompt again alone (the packed-trace replay then the program compiled after the capture: the four-card hang sequence), the platform's eight non-streamed requests at once (replay_concurrent8,
# the deterministic hang shape in the traffic the platform sends) and the drain of the eight. READ: every user at budget, no error, no hang, SMOKE_CHECK clean, the tool call arrives as tool_calls deltas with no
# <tool_call> marker in the content. Measured basis: attach 2 to 5 minutes, a short test about one minute, an eight-user round of 300 tokens seconds (production serves eight-live rounds in about 175 ms).
# TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the third session of 2026-10-08/09 (s0809) (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it). ORDER.txt has the order, the classes, the minutes, the boxes, the tags
# and every rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-11 is the window image (the Lever N traffic profile baked in as its default); tp4-serve-10 is the production base image. C2_BOX_MINUTES is the job's box:
# the workflow enforces it from inside, it never cancels a run. NO profile of this pack carries a digest or an audit (QWEN_PREFIX_DIGESTS, QWEN_PREFIX_AUDIT, the lever audits): test_tp4_session_0809 pins that.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-11
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-traffic
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady,steady_resend,stream_tool_call,stream_reasoning,replay_concurrent8,concurrent8_drain
C2_BOX_MINUTES=25
